{"id":21037,"name":"最后的赢家","rarity":4,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「你信不过我？」</i>\\n他挑衅地看着面前的男人，拿出一把手枪，清空子弹，只余一颗。\\n\\n<i>「看来，要想合作愉快，还得向你解释一下我的做事风格。」</i>\\n他将手枪塞到对方手中，转动转轮，将枪口对准自己。\\n\\n他连续扣动扳机，三声空响之后笑容无异。\\n<i>「生命是一场盛大的豪赌，而我总是最后的赢家。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21037,"name":"下注","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。当装备者对敌方目标造成暴击后获得一层【好运】，最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>层。每层【好运】使装备者的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，【好运】在装备者的回合结束时移除。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.08,4]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.14,0.09,4]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.16,0.1,4]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.18,0.11,4]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.2,0.12,4]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":15,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":33,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110121,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":57,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":81,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":105,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110123,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114013,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":371.52,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":185.76,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":129,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":70,"cost":[